      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this fantastic one-bedroom apartment to the Dublin 8 property market. Positioned on the upper floors of the secure and highly sought-after Bertram Court development on Lamb Alley, this property offers the ultimate in city-centre living. No. 140 is presented in clean condition throughout and represents a phenomenal opportunity for first-time buyers looking to step onto the property ladder or savvy investors looking for a high-yield asset in a prime location with historical rental demand.\n\nThe location is truly next to none. Tucked away securely off High Street, you are within a short stroll of Christchurch Cathedral, Temple Bar, Dame Street, and Trinity College. The absolute heart of Dublin City Centre is quite literally on your doorstep, meaning you are surrounded by an endless choice of artisan cafes, trendy restaurants, bars, and cultural hotspots. For commuters, public transport options are unrivalled the Luas line is within easy walking distance, while countless major bus routes sit right outside on High Street, providing effortless access across the city.\n\nBright and intelligently laid out internal living accommodation flows beautifully from the moment you step inside. A welcoming entrance hallway leads first into a generous main family bathroom. Continuing through, you meet a large, spacious double bedroom that offers excellent space for storage. The accommodation is completed by a wonderfully bright, open-plan kitchen and living room area that is flooded with natural light, creating a warm and inviting space perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nNo. 140 Bertram Court is a premium example of city living at an accessible price point, offering a secure, low-maintenance base in a central location. Early viewing is highly advised \nCall RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n•C 44 sq m \n•BER C\n•Mngt fees c. 1200\n•Bright and spacious open-plan layout\n•Well-proportioned accommodation via entrance hallway\n•Generous main family bathroom\n•Large, comfortable double bedroom\n•Light-filled kitchen and living room space\n•Secure, gated mature development\n•Located in the absolute heart of Dublin 8\n•Christchurch, Temple Bar, and Dame Street within minutes\n•Unrivaled public transport links with Luas and bus corridors nearby\n•Ideal for First-Time Buyers and Savvy Investors alike\n\nDirections\nTraveling from Dame Street, proceed straight onto Cork Hill and continue along Lord Edward Street onto High Street. Pass Christchurch Cathedral on your right-hand side. Take the left-hand turn just before the old city wall onto Lamb Alley, and the secure gates to Bertram Court will be located immediately on your right-hand side.\n"
      },
      {
